OL,3,AThe rise and fall of Jensen Huang - how
OL,4,Athe tech superstar became mired in
OL,5,Ascandal
OL,6,
OL,7,FJensen Huang, known for sporting a
OL,8,Fblack leather jacket to shareholder
OL,9,Fevents, appeared to have it all. He was
OL,10,Fcourted by leaders in the US and China
OL,11,Falike, worshipped by investors and seen
OL,12,Fas a loyal family man. But a rockstar
OL,13,Fapproach to his personal life has
OL,14,Fultimately led to his resignation.
OL,16,FThe 63-year-old has been married since
OL,17,F1985, long before the foundation of
OL,18,FNvidia, the company that propelled him
OL,19,Fto tech stardom.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
PN,11904
SC,0004
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1794512896
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AThe rise and fall of Jensen Huang - how
OL,4,Athe tech superstar became mired in
OL,5,Ascandal
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe is known as a workaholic and a
OL,8,Fdemanding manager, with high standards
OL,9,Ffor those who worked for him, which
OL,10,Fincluded his own children, promoted
OL,11,Fwithin the company. But he has seen his
OL,12,Fpersonal reputation go into freefall
OL,13,Fthis week, undone by romantic
OL,14,Fentanglements that throw doubt on his
OL,15,Ffocus and his judgement.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
