OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1794512896
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AZoe Kleinman: How AI visionary Jensen
OL,4,AHuang was undone by his own bad
OL,5,Adecisions
OL,6,
OL,7,FIf I'd told you this time last week
OL,8,Fthat Jensen Huang was about to leave
OL,9,FNvidia, you would not have believed me.
OL,11,FThe man who co-founded this enormously
OL,12,Fsuccessful AI chip company, working
OL,13,Ftirelessly to build it from the ground
OL,14,Fup and steering it through some
OL,15,Fdisastrous times with endless energy
OL,16,Fand ruthless determination, has
OL,17,Fultimately been undone by his own love
OL,18,Flife.
OL,20,FIt's an extraordinary tale and a
OL,21,Fstrangely old fashioned one for a tech
OL,22,Ffirm with its sights set on the future.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,108,105,200,160,0,100
